                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rule my-8" />

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[11px] font-mono text-on-surface-subtle">
            <p>
              © {new Date().getFullYear()} Richard McKellar · mckellar.dev · All rights reserved.
            </p>
            <p>
